## FRONTEND — React + Vite + TailwindCSS

### Design System
Dark-on-light premium educational aesthetic:
- Background: `#F8FAFC`, Surface cards: `#FFFFFF`, Primary accent: `#6366F1` (indigo-500), Secondary: `#8B5CF6` (violet-500)
- Text primary: `#0F172A`, Text secondary: `#64748B`
