- Featured courses section (3 cards)
- Stats bar: e.g. "500+ Students", "20+ Courses", "Free Forever", "Certificates Included"
- Instructor highlights strip
- Footer

**`/courses`** — Course Catalogue
- Search bar + filter chips: category (All / Web Dev / Python / Data Science) + level filter
- Grid of CourseCard components: thumbnail, title, instructor name, level badge, estimated duration, "Enroll" or "Continue" CTA
- Empty state with friendly message

**`/courses/:slug`** — Course Detail
- Hero with thumbnail, title, instructor, stats (enrolled count, lessons count, duration, level)
- Tabs: Overview | Curriculum | Instructor
- Curriculum tab: collapsible sections listing lessons with lock icons for non-enrolled users
- Sticky enroll/continue banner
- Final exam section (locked until all lessons complete)

**`/learn/:slug`** — Course Viewer (protected, enrolled only)
- Left sidebar (280px, dark #1E293B): course sections + lessons list; active lesson highlighted in indigo; completion checkmarks
- Main content area: video player (iframe embed), lesson description, resources list (download links), quiz section, coding challenge section
- Right-side: lesson navigation (prev/next), progress indicator
- Quiz: multiple-choice, show score + explanations on submit
- Coding challenge: textarea for code input, submit button, pass/fail feedback

**`/exam/:courseId`** — Final Exam (protected, enrolled + all lessons complete)
- Timer display (countdown from timeLimit)
- Paginated or scrollable question list with radio options
- Submit → results screen showing score, pass/fail, and if passed: certificate download button

**`/dashboard`** — Student Dashboard (protected)
- Greeting with user name
- Stats row: Enrolled courses, Completed courses, Certificates earned
- Enrolled Courses section: cards with progress bar (% complete), last accessed date, "Continue" button
- Recent Activity feed (latest lesson completions / quiz attempts)
- Certificates section: certificate cards with course name, issued date, download & share buttons

**`/admin`** — Admin Dashboard (admin only)
- Stats: total courses, total students, total exams passed
- Quick actions: "New Course", "Manage Courses", "View Users"
- Published vs Draft courses table

**`/admin/courses/new`** and **`/admin/courses/:id/edit`** — Course Builder
- Multi-step form or tabbed editor: Basic Info | Sections & Lessons | Final Exam | Publish
- Basic Info: title, description, category, level, thumbnail URL, estimated duration
- Sections & Lessons: add/remove/reorder sections; within each section add lessons (title, videoUrl, resources, quiz questions, coding challenge)
- Final Exam: add/remove questions, set passingScore, timeLimit
- Publish toggle

**`/instructors`** — Instructors listing page
- Grid of instructor cards: avatar (initials fallback), name, bio excerpt, course count

**`/instructors/:id`** — Instructor Profile
- Full bio, avatar, stats, grid of their published courses

**`/certificate/:certificateId`** — Public certificate page
- Printable/shareable certificate layout: student name, course name, issued date, unique certificate ID
- "Download as PDF" button (use browser print / `window.print()`)
- Certificate has decorative border, indigo accent, platform logo text "Learnify"

### Global Components
- **Navbar**: logo "Learnify" (indigo), nav links (Courses, Instructors), auth buttons or user avatar dropdown (Dashboard, Sign Out)
- **ProtectedRoute**: redirect to `/auth` if no JWT
- **AdminRoute**: redirect to `/dashboard` if not admin role
- **CourseCard**: reusable card with thumbnail, badges, progress bar (if enrolled)
- **ProgressBar**: animated indigo fill
- **AuthContext**: wrap app; expose `user`, `login()`, `logout()`, `loading`
- **API utility** (`/client/src/utils/api.js`): axios instance with `baseURL = /api`, auto-attach Authorization header from localStorage JWT

### Routing (react-router-dom v6)
```
/ → Home
/auth → Auth (redirect if already logged in)
/courses → Catalogue
/courses/:slug → Detail
/learn/:slug → Viewer (ProtectedRoute)
/exam/:courseId → Exam (ProtectedRoute)
/dashboard → Dashboard (ProtectedRoute)
/admin → AdminDashboard (AdminRoute)
/admin/courses/new → CourseBuilder (AdminRoute)
/admin/courses/:id/edit → CourseBuilder (AdminRoute)
/instructors → Instructors
/instructors/:id → InstructorProfile
/certificate/:certificateId → Certificate (public)
```

